1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/llm/weight-typing","children":["大白话解释 GPT 架构中的权重共享"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"article-hero article-cover","children":["$","img",null,{"className":"u-photo","src":"https://hedon.top/hedonspace/banner/weight-typing.jpg","alt":"大白话解释 GPT 架构中的权重共享 的文章封面"}]}],["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"大模型"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"大白话解释 GPT 架构中的权重共享"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本篇用外语学习的比喻，深入浅出地解释 GPT 架构中的权重共享技术，从听写记忆到表达记忆，帮助你理解这个提升大模型效率的核心优化策略"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2025-08-13T16:30:20.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2025/08/13"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","1,613"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":["在当今的大模型时代，GPT 架构以其强大的能力席卷了整个 AI 领域。当你深入探究其内部结构时，会发现许多精妙的设计。其中一个看似简单、却能带来巨大效益的工程技巧，就是我们今天要讨论的——",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"权重共享（Weight Tying）"}],"。"]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"1-什么是权重共享","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#1-什么是权重共享","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#1-什么是权重共享"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"1. 什么是权重共享？","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":4,"offset":122},"end":{"line":3,"column":15,"offset":133}}}]},"children":"1. 什么是权重共享？"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"想象一下你在学习一门外语。有两个过程："}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"听写"}],"：听到一个词后，你需要在脑海中构建它的意思。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"表达"}],"：你想表达一个意思时，需要从词库中挑出最合适的词。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"一个高效的学习者会发现，这两个过程是相辅相成的。你对一个词理解得越深（听写），就越能准确地使用它（表达）。反之亦然。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":"在 GPT 模型中，权重共享就是将这两个过程的\"记忆\"绑定在一起。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":"具体来说，模型有两个关键的权重矩阵："}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"输入嵌入（Input Embedding）"}],"：将输入的离散 Token（如单词 \"cat\"）转换成连续的向量表示。这就像是你的\"听写记忆\"。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"输出线性层（Output Linear Layer）"}],"：将模型内部的向量表示转换回离散的 Token，用于预测下一个词。这就像是你的\"表达记忆\"。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-5",{"children":"更具体来说："}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-1",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"输入嵌入矩阵（Input Embedding Matrix） Wemb"}],"：这是一个将离散的 Token（词汇表中的 ID）映射到连续向量空间（Token Embedding）的矩阵。它的维度是 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"[词汇表大小, 模型维度]"}],"。当一个 Token ID 比如 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"5234"}]," 进来时，模型会查找这个矩阵的第 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"5234"}]," 行，将其作为这个 Token 的向量表示。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"输出词表线性层（Output Vocabulary Linear Layer）Wout"}],"：这是模型在最后一步用来预测下一个 Token 的矩阵。它的维度是 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"[模型维度, 词汇表大小]"}],"。模型经过一系列 Transformer Block 处理后，会得到一个 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"[1, 模型维度]"}]," 的输出向量，这个向量会与 Wout 进行矩阵乘法，得到一个 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"[1, 词汇表大小]"}]," 的 Logits 向量。这个向量的每个值代表了词汇表中相应 Token 的概率分数，通过 Softmax 归一化后，就可以得到下一个词的概率分布。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-6",{"children":["权重共享的精髓在于，它",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"将输出线性层的权重矩阵，设置为输入嵌入矩阵的转置"}],"。这意味着，模型在学习如何编码（理解）一个词时，也在同步学习如何解码（生成）这个词。"]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-1",{"id":"2-为什么要这样做","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#2-为什么要这样做","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#2-为什么要这样做"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"2. 为什么要这样做？","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":4,"offset":1040},"end":{"line":26,"column":15,"offset":1051}}}]},"children":"2. 为什么要这样做？"}]}],"\n",["$","h3","h3-0",{"id":"浅层原因参数效率","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#浅层原因参数效率","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#浅层原因参数效率"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"浅层原因：参数效率","position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":5,"offset":1057},"end":{"line":28,"column":14,"offset":1066}}}]},"children":"浅层原因：参数效率"}]}],"\n","$L8","\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15"]}]}],"$L16","$L17","$L18"]}],"$L19"]}]]}]}]
